(Thus steps:)
(1. Load origin payload (load_origin_payload) -> sets origin_availability_locked, origin_node_occupied, origin_payload_linked, cargo unavailable.)
(2. Unload origin payload (unload_origin_payload) -> sets origin_availability_confirmed, origin_node_ready, cargo available, removes origin_payload_linked.)
(Now we have origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed, origin_node_occupied, origin_node_ready.)
(3. Load destination payload (load_destination_payload) -> sets destination_availability_locked, destination_node_occupied, destination_payload_linked, cargo unavailable.)
(4. Unload destination payload (unload_destination_payload) -> sets destination_availability_confirmed, destination_node_ready, cargo available, removes destination_payload_linked.)
(Now we have destination_availability_locked, destination_availability_confirmed, destination_node_occupied, destination_node_ready.)
(Now we have origin and destination ready for leg assembly.)
